            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Coxhead Motorhomes</strong></div><p><strong>Representative:</strong> Dave Sparrow</p><p><strong>Model of motorhome recommended:</strong> 'Two berth end kitchen'</p><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Cost</strong> £545 – £755 per week</p><ul><li>Damage deposit: £{{1}} (for drivers of 21–25)</li><li>No charge for an {{2}} driver</li><li>An {{3}} driving licence is acceptable</li><li>All vehicles are under 30 months old</li><li>All motorhomes have {{4}} gearboxes</li><li>Customers' {{5}} are allowed</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Facilities</p><ul><li>All cooking facilities including a {{6}} and a microwave</li><li>A {{7}} (new this year)</li><li>Satellite navigation system</li><li>A {{8}} rack</li><li>Electricity: mains hook-up or can hire a {{9}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Collection</p><ul><li>Nearest station: {{10}} (customers can be picked up from there)</li></ul></div>",
